#: ../../configuration.md:142
msgid "Worker delegation"
msgstr "Worker 委派"

#: ../../configuration.md:144
msgid ""
"With `[worker] provider` set and `runtime.worker` on, the model gains a "
"`Delegate` tool that hands a bounded task to a second session **in the "
"same process** (the worker). The worker runs on its own configured "
"provider — usually a different vendor than `provider.active`, so its "
"reviews cross-validate the parent's — with its own system prompt and a "
"reduced tool set, and it keeps its context across delegations until you "
"reset it."
msgstr ""
"设置 `[worker] provider` 且启用 `runtime.worker` 后，模型获得一个 `Delegate` "
"工具，可将有限的任务交给**同一进程内**的第二个会话（worker）。worker 使用自己配置的 provider——通常是与 "
"`provider.active` "
"不同的厂商，以便它的审查与父会话互相验证——使用自己的系统提示和精简的工具集，并在各次委派之间保留上下文，直到你重置它。"

#: ../../configuration.md:161
msgid ""
"A `Delegate` call runs to completion before the parent's turn continues: "
"you see the worker's progress in the status bar, and the worker's final "
"text is returned to the parent model, which decides what to do next. A "
"worker is a full minacode session — compaction, Recall, tools, skills, "
"confirmation — projected from the parent's state: it shares the parent's "
"cwd, environment, Note tool, skill library, and MCP servers, but only "
"files and the repo really belong to both."
msgstr ""
"`Delegate` 调用会完整执行完毕后父会话才继续：你可以在状态栏看到 worker 的进度，worker "
"的最终文本会返回给父模型，由它决定下一步。worker 是一个完整的 minacode "
"会话——压缩、Recall、工具、技能、确认——从父会话的状态投影而来：它共享父会话的 cwd、环境、Note 工具、技能库和 MCP "
"server，但真正同时属于双方的只有文件和仓库。"

#: ../../configuration.md:167
msgid ""
"`/worker` shows status, `/worker on`/`/worker off` toggle "
"`runtime.worker` for the session, and `/worker reset` clears the worker's"
" context. Turning delegation off or resetting the worker never removes "
"file changes or merged diffs — the worker owns only its conversation, and"
" reset drops that conversation (and the wrong beliefs it may have "
"accumulated) on purpose."
msgstr ""
"`/worker` 显示状态，`/worker on`/`/worker off` 切换当前 session 的 "
"`runtime.worker`，`/worker reset` 清除 worker 的上下文。关闭委派或重置 worker "
"都不会删除文件改动或已合并的 diff——worker 只拥有自己的对话，而重置正是有意丢弃这段对话（以及它可能积累的错误认知）。"

#: ../../configuration.md:172
msgid ""
"The worker's provider, model, reasoning effort, and wire protocol can be "
"changed at runtime, mirroring the parent's `/provider` `/model` `/reason`"
" `/api` temporary switches: `/worker provider NAME` re-targets the worker"
" (`/worker provider off` clears the entry), `/worker model MODEL`, "
"`/worker reason EFFORT`, and `/worker api API` override the entry's "
"model, reasoning effort, and wire protocol, and `default` in place of a "
"value clears an override. A change applies to a live worker immediately "
"and to future spawns, and is session-scoped like `/provider` — it is not "
"written back to the config file. The `Delegate` tool block is fixed at "
"session start from `[worker] provider`: changing the provider mid-session"
" tunes an already-enabled delegation, but enabling delegation from "
"scratch (provider unset at start) takes effect after a restart. Set the "
"same defaults persistently with the `[worker] model`, `[worker] "
"reasoning`, and `[worker] api` keys above."
msgstr "worker 的 provider、模型、推理强度与 wire 协议可以在运行时修改,与父级的 `/provider` `/model` `/reaso"
"n` `/api` 临时切换保持一致:`/worker provider NAME` 重新指定 worker(`/worker provider off"
"` 清除条目),`/worker model MODEL`、`/worker reason EFFORT` 与 `/worker api API` 覆盖"
"条目的模型、推理强度与 wire 协议,以 `default` 代替值即可清除覆盖。修改立即作用于当前 worker,也对未来的生成生效,并且与 `/p"
"rovider` 一样是 session 级的——不会写回配置文件。`Delegate` 工具块在会话启动时根据 `[worker] provider`"
" 固定:会话中途更换 provider 只能调优已启用的委派,从头启用委派(启动时未设置 provider)需要重启后生效。持久化设置同样的默认值,请使"
"用上文的 `[worker] model`、`[worker] reasoning` 与 `[worker] api` 键。"

#: ../../configuration.md:184
msgid "Data location"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: ../../configuration.md:191
msgid ""
"Sessions live under `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`, one directory per "
"working directory. Each holds that project's session logs and a `latest` "
"pointer, so a resume stays scoped to the project it belongs to. A project"
" directory is removed once its last session expires."
msgstr ""
"Session 保存在 `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`，每个工作目录对应一个子目录，其中存放该项目的 "
"session 日志和 `latest` 指针，因此恢复操作始终限定在所属项目内。当某个项目的最后一个 session "
"过期后，对应目录会被一并删除。"

#: ../../configuration.md:195
msgid ""
"Beside each log sits a small `<uid>.meta.json` holding what the session "
"picker shows — name, opening line, round count. The log stays the source "
"of truth; deleting a sidecar only costs that session its label in the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"每份日志旁还有一个很小的 `<uid>.meta.json`，保存 session "
"选择器所展示的内容——名称、开场行、轮数。日志始终是事实来源；删掉这个文件只会让该 session 在列表中失去标签。"

#: ../../configuration.md:199
msgid ""
"`<data_dir>/history.txt` holds the input history that Up and Ctrl-P "
"recall, across every project. It is capped at 512 KB, keeping the most "
"recent entries."
msgstr ""
"`<data_dir>/history.txt` 保存所有项目共用的输入历史，供 Up 与 Ctrl-P 调取。该文件上限为 512 "
"KB，仅保留最近的条目。"

